EN:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}I've really enjoyed chatting with
you.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} But the thing is,{{TAG:0007:0000:03000000}} I need a little
time to myself now{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}If you still want to talk later,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} 
I'll be around.{{TAG:000B:0005:03CD}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Te aseguro que me gusta mucho
hablar contigo, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}pero{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} también
necesito tiempo para mí misma.{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
Si quieres, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}hablamos más tarde.{{TAG:000B:0005:03CD}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Seninle konuşmak gerçekten
