kendime vakit ayırmam gerek{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Sonra hâlâ konuşmak istersen,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
buralarda olurum.{{TAG:000B:0005:03CD}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0028:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}Sorry. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:000B:}}I'm trying to make a decision,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
and I need some quiet time in order
to evaluate all the options.
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Let's chat later,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:000B:0005:03CD}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0028:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}Üzgünüm. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Bir karar vermeye
